    "membership": "isOpenAndThunkable weak-loads workspaceScene. Missing scene or no match returns false. It iterates scene.thunkableSourceIdentifiers and compares each optional originalFile URL with the changed path fileURL represented as present URL, using imported URL Equatable machinery. A match returns true. Exact Foundation URL equality/normalization semantics are not separately qualified.",
